Nimeitisha tayari kupitia programu ya simu yangu.

41
00:01:58,356 --> 00:02:00,036
Asante.

42
00:02:00,059 --> 00:02:04,593
Itakuwa mbele ya ofisi katika dakika tano hivi.

43
00:02:04,616 --> 00:02:06,782
Nikusanye vitu vyangu.

44
00:02:06,805 --> 00:02:09,805
Nitakubeba mfuko wako.

45
00:02:09,828 --> 00:02:13,509
Asante kwa kila kitu.

46
00:02:13,533 --> 00:02:17,699
Upole. Pumzika vizuri.

47
00:02:17,722 --> 00:02:19,522
Asante.

48
00:02:19,545 --> 00:02:21,712
Nitakuona baadaye.

49
00:02:21,735 --> 00:02:23,235
Sehemu ya 2: Baada ya kazi na mpango wa chakula cha jioni

50
00:02:23,235 --> 00:02:27,568
Kazi ya leo imemalizika, sawa?

51
00:02:27,591 --> 00:02:30,658
Ndiyo, nimechoka sana.

52
00:02:30,681 --> 00:02:33,648
Mwili wote unauma.

53
00:02:33,671 --> 00:02:36,485
Tulitembea sana.

54
00:02:36,508 --> 00:02:39,108
Kweli kabisa.

55
00:02:39,131 --> 00:02:42,331
Miguu inaniuma mno.

56
00:02:42,354 --> 00:02:47,320
Baada ya hii, tutakwenda kula chakula cha jioni pamoja?

57
00:02:47,343 --> 00:02:49,277
Sawa sana.

58
00:02:49,300 --> 00:02:52,199
Nina njaa sana.

59
00:02:52,222 --> 00:02:55,622
Unataka kula kitu gani?

60
00:02:55,645 --> 00:02:58,978
Ninapenda nyama.

61
00:02:59,001 --> 00:03:03,854
Kuna mgahawa mzuri wa nyama choma karibu na hapa.

62
00:03:03,878 --> 00:03:05,811
Twende huko.

63
00:03:05,834 --> 00:03:08,167
Nataka kula sana.

64
00:03:08,190 --> 00:03:10,957
Koo yangu limekauka pia.

65
00:03:10,980 --> 00:03:14,713
Ndiyo, koo langu limekauka kabisa.

66
00:03:14,736 --> 00:03:17,976
Tutakunywa bia baridi?

67
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:20,366
Mimi nitakunywa chai.

68
00:03:20,389 --> 00:03:23,757
Je, leo hutatwa pombe?

69
00:03:23,780 --> 00:03:27,647
Ndiyo, leo nimekuja na gari.

70
00:03:27,670 --> 00:03:30,470
Aa, ndivyo ilivyo.

71
00:03:30,493 --> 00:03:32,826
Nimekwama kabisa.

72
00:03:32,849 --> 00:03:36,651
Je, mgahawa wa nyama choma uko mbali kutoka hapa?

73
