Nimekosea kidogo.

97
00:04:39,026 --> 00:04:42,259
Sikuelewa kabisa.

98
00:04:42,282 --> 00:04:44,559
Ulikuwa mzuri sana.

99
00:04:44,583 --> 00:04:48,383
Kabla ya kuanza, moyo wangu ulikuwa unacheza sana.

100
00:04:48,406 --> 00:04:52,039
Kulikuwa na watu wengi.

101
00:04:52,062 --> 00:04:54,315
Nilikuwa na wasiwasi.

102
00:04:54,339 --> 00:04:57,906
Katika kati ya hotuba, niliwahi kusahau maneno.

103
00:04:57,929 --> 00:05:01,574
Ulikoma kidogo.

104
00:05:01,598 --> 00:05:04,998
Nilikuwa na wasiwasi kwamba nitafeli.

105
00:05:05,021 --> 00:05:08,512
Mimi pia nilikuwa na wasiwasi kidogo.

106
00:05:08,535 --> 00:05:12,737
Lakini niliweza kumaliza hotuba yangu.

107
00:05:12,761 --> 00:05:15,494
Kweli ilikuwa vizuri sana.

108
00:05:15,517 --> 00:05:17,520
Ulikuwa mzuri sana.

109
00:05:17,543 --> 00:05:21,680
Kwa kuwa imemalizika, sasa ninafuraahi sana.

110
00:05:21,704 --> 00:05:24,304
Nimefuraahi sana.

111
