Aa, ninaona raha ya kutoka kwenye mabega.

112
00:05:28,192 --> 00:05:30,959
Familia yako pia walikuja kuona?

113
00:05:30,982 --> 00:05:35,715
Ndiyo, wazazi wangu walikuwa kwenye kiti cha mbele kabisa.

114
00:05:35,738 --> 00:05:39,538
Nafikiri wazazi wako wanafurahi sana.

115
00:05:39,561 --> 00:05:43,294
Baada ya hapo, tutakula pamoja.

116
00:05:43,317 --> 00:05:45,351
Ni nzuri sana!

117
00:05:45,374 --> 00:05:47,907
Mtakula nini?

118
00:05:47,930 --> 00:05:50,663
Tutakwenda kula sushi.

119
00:05:50,686 --> 00:05:52,622
Sawa sana.

120
00:05:52,645 --> 00:05:55,612
Ni kwa sababu ya wewe, mwalimu.

121
00:05:55,635 --> 00:06:00,002
Hapana, mimi sijafanya chochote.

122
00:06:00,025 --> 00:06:03,834
Uliwahi kunifuatilia kila siku wakati wa mazoezi.

123
00:06:03,857 --> 00:06:07,224
Ni kwa sababu wewe ulijaribu sana.

124
00:06:07,247 --> 00:06:12,214
Mara inayofuata nitajaribu kwa mada ngumu zaidi.

125
00:06:12,237 --> 00:06:14,570
Tunangojea kwa hamu.

126
00:06:14,593 --> 00:06:17,476
Leo hii pumzika kwa utulivu.

127
00:06:17,499 --> 00:06:20,954
Ndiyo, asante sana.

128
00:06:20,977 --> 00:06:22,477
Sehemu ya 4: Gari la moshi limechelewa na wasiwasi

129
00:06:22,477 --> 00:06:25,044
Una shida gani?

130
00:06:25,067 --> 00:06:28,433
Gari la moshi halitaki kuja.

131
00:06:28,456 --> 00:06:31,862
Gari la moshi halitaki kuja.

132
