Kuna ajali imetokea.

133
00:06:34,943 --> 00:06:37,402
Ni kweli hiyo?

134
00:06:37,425 --> 00:06:40,391
Sikujua kabisa.

135
00:06:40,414 --> 00:06:43,669
Limechelewa kwa dakika thelathini hivi.

136
00:06:43,693 --> 00:06:47,826
Nakasirika kwa sababu muda unapotea bure.

137
00:06:47,849 --> 00:06:50,260
Una haraka?

138
