Sawa.

144
00:07:07,094 --> 00:07:10,060
Nimepeleka ujumbe kidogo sasa hivi.

145
00:07:10,083 --> 00:07:13,287
Rafiki yako alisema nini?

146
00:07:13,311 --> 00:07:17,477
Alisema ataanza kuingia sinema mapema.

147
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:20,334
Filamu uliyokuwa unangojea kwa hamu?

148
00:07:20,357 --> 00:07:21,890
Sawa.

149
00:07:21,913 --> 00:07:25,356
Ni filamu ya action ambayo nimetamani kuiona kwa muda mrefu.

150
00:07:25,379 --> 00:07:29,979
Ni hasira kuwa sitapata kuiona tangu mwanzo.

151
00:07:30,002 --> 00:07:33,038
Ni kweli ni jambo la kusikitisha.

152
00:07:33,062 --> 00:07:36,495
Gari la moshi linakuja lini?

153
00:07:36,518 --> 00:07:40,318
Hata kwenye taa ya matangazo haionekani.

154
00:07:40,341 --> 00:07:43,775
Tufanyeje, tuulize afisa wa stesheni?

155
00:07:43,798 --> 00:07:45,231
Ndiyo.

156
00:07:45,254 --> 00:07:48,621
Afisa wa stesheni yuko pale.

157
00:07:48,644 --> 00:07:51,010
Nitakwenda kuuliza.

158
00:07:51,033 --> 00:07:53,211
Alisema nini?

159
00:07:53,235 --> 00:07:57,251
Alisema itaanza kusogea baada ya dakika kumi.

160
00:07:57,274 --> 00:07:59,755
Hiyo ni habari njema.

161
00:07:59,778 --> 00:08:02,916
Umepata kupunguza wasiwasi kidogo?

162
00:08:02,939 --> 00:08:04,551
Sawa.

163
00:08:04,575 --> 00:08:06,775
Nimepata kupata raha kidogo.

164
00:08:06,798 --> 00:08:10,401
Furahia filamu yako.

165
00:08:10,425 --> 00:08:12,192
Asante.

166
00:08:12,215 --> 00:08:14,551
Nitakwenda.

167
00:08:14,574 --> 00:08:16,074
Sehemu ya 5: Mipango ya safari ya likizo ya baridi

168
00:08:16,074 --> 00:08:19,874
