169
00:08:19,897 --> 00:08:23,555
Ndiyo, ninawasubiri sana.

170
00:08:23,578 --> 00:08:27,180
Una mpango wa kwenda mahali popote?

171
00:08:27,204 --> 00:08:31,048
Nitakwenda Hokkaido pamoja na familia yangu.

172
00:08:31,071 --> 00:08:35,405
Hokkaido? Ni nzuri sana!

173
00:08:35,428 --> 00:08:40,228
Ni mara yangu ya kwanza kuwa katika nchi ya theluji, na nina furaha sana.

174
00:08:40,251 --> 00:08:43,017
Baridi sana huko.

175
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:46,174
Umewanunua nguo nzito?

176
00:08:46,196 --> 00:08:51,130
Ndiyo, nimenunua koti mpya yenye joto.

177
00:08:51,153 --> 00:08:56,019
Kuvivaa nguo mpya kunanifanya nijisikie furaha!

178
00:08:56,042 --> 00:08:59,976
Ndiyo, napenda kuivaa mapema.

179
00:08:59,999 --> 00:09:03,696
Utakwenda kufanya nini huko Hokkaido?

180
00:09:03,719 --> 00:09:06,652
Nina mpango wa kufanya skiing.

181
00:09:06,675 --> 00:09:09,528
Je, unaweza skiing vizuri?

182
00:09:09,552 --> 00:09:12,236
Sipendi kabisa.

183
00:09:12,259 --> 00:09:14,926
Ni uzoefu wangu wa kwanza.

184
00:09:14,949 --> 00:09:17,949
Hakika utapata furaha.

185
00:09:17,972 --> 00:09:20,705
Theluji pia ni nzuri.

186
00:09:20,728 --> 00:09:24,095
Natamani kula donburi ya samaki yenye ladha.

187
00:09:24,118 --> 00:09:27,684
Kaa na samoni ni tamu sana.

188
00:09:27,707 --> 00:09:32,742
Kwa kuzungumza tu, nina hamu ya kwenda mapema.

189
00:09:32,766 --> 00:09:37,203
Leo sijafanya kazi kwa makini kabisa.

190
00:09:37,227 --> 00:09:40,793
Ndiyo, ninaangalia saa mara kwa mara.

191
00:09:40,816 --> 00:09:45,050
Umeangalia tiketi ya ndege?

192
00:09:45,073 --> 00:09:47,917
Ndiyo, nimeiangalia.

193
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:51,274
Je, umefanya hifadhi ya hoteli?

194
00:09:51,297 --> 00:09:54,697
Ndiyo, kila kitu ni salama.

195
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:58,686
Usisahau kubeba kamera yako.

196
00:09:58,709 --> 00:10:02,143
Nitapiga picha nyingi kwa simu yangu.

197
00:10:02,166 --> 00:10:05,932
Ninangojea kupata picha nzuri.

198
00:10:05,955 --> 00:10:08,931
Nitakujaza picha zote Jumatatu.

199
00:10:08,954 --> 00:10:11,621
Safari njema.

200
00:10:11,644 --> 00:10:13,777
Ndiyo, nitaondoka.

201
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:16,979
Nitakuletea zawadi.

202
00:10:17,003 --> 00:10:18,503
Sehemu ya 6: Usingizi na Hisia za Asubuhi / Usingizi na Hisia za Asubuhi

203
00:10:18,503 --> 00:10:20,923
Habari za asubuhi.

204
00:10:20,946 --> 00:10:23,313
Habari za asubuhi.

205
00:10:23,336 --> 00:10:26,912
Leo umeamka mapema kuliko kawaida.

206
00:10:26,935 --> 00:10:31,203
Jana nililala mapema sana.

207
00:10:31,227 --> 00:10:34,270
Umelala usingizi mzuri?

208
00:10:34,293 --> 00:10:38,500
Ndiyo, sikupata usingizi hadi asubuhi.

209
00:10:38,523 --> 00:10:41,490
Hiyo ni nzuri.

210
00:10:41,513 --> 00:10:46,148
Kwa sababu hiyo, leo asubuhi najisikia vizuri sana.

211
00:10:46,171 --> 00:10:48,987
Unaonekana mwenye nguvu sana.

212
00:10:49,010 --> 00:10:53,377
Ndiyo. Wewe unavipendekeza kuwa na usingizi kidogo.

213
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:58,499
Kweli nilicheza michezo hadi usiku wa manane.

214
00:10:58,522 --> 00:11:01,016
Umelala kwa saa ngapi?

215
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:04,138
Kama saa tatu.

216
00:11:04,161 --> 00:11:07,096
Hiyo ni fupi mno.

217
00:11:07,119 --> 00:11:09,160
Ina madhara kwa afya yako.

218
00:11:09,184 --> 00:11:14,080
Ndiyo, nililala katika mkutano uliopita.

219
