Leo baada ya kazi, nataka kurudi nyumbani mapema.

224
00:11:30,991 --> 00:11:34,924
Je, umekamilisha kazi ya leo?

225
00:11:34,947 --> 00:11:39,081
Bado zipo kazi ndogo za kutengeneza hati.

226
00:11:39,105 --> 00:11:42,305
Naweza kukusaidia?

227
00:11:42,328 --> 00:11:44,506
Kweli?

228
00:11:44,530 --> 00:11:46,730
Unaonisaidia sana.

229
00:11:46,753 --> 00:11:49,919
Unatengeneza hati gani?

230
00:11:49,942 --> 00:11:55,014
Tafadhali ingiza data kutoka karatasi hii kwenye kompyuta.

231
00:11:55,038 --> 00:11:57,238
Nimeelewa.

232
00:11:57,261 --> 00:11:59,297
Nitafanya mara moja.

233
00:11:59,321 --> 00:12:03,254
Mimi nitajibu barua pepe.

234
00:12:03,277 --> 00:12:07,410
Tukimaliza, twende pamoja nyumbani.

235
