Chumba kitakuwa na nafasi zaidi.

253
00:13:11,932 --> 00:13:16,865
Mizigo ya kuhamia nyumba mpya ni kidogo.

254
00:13:16,888 --> 00:13:21,708
Je, nyumba mpya ina chumba gani?

255
00:13:21,731 --> 00:13:27,664
